{"synopsis":"“Zhang Yuan” naik ke alam dewa melalui kultivasi, namun malah terdampar di dunia yang aneh. Di langit sana bercokol para dewa dan Buddha yang mengerikan, sementara manusia di dunia fana hanya bagaikan hewan ternak. Di mana-mana penuh dengan makhluk aneh yang berbahaya, para kultivator pun hidup sengsara dalam keadaan tak jelas, setengah manusia setengah makhluk lain. Masih adakah harapan bagi dunia ini? Zhang Yuan tak peduli, yang dia inginkan hanyalah kembali naik ke alam dewa. Tapi… apakah dia benar-benar bisa kembali?","alternative_title":"诡浊仙道","author":"Thrush Animation","artist":"Thrush Animation","chapters":[{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"ecf023f6-40fb-4c93-8fb9-910dc7ed4fb1","date":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"2e0bff03-6f94-4c30-9acb-4b42aa502187","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"4262ac9b-4b41-4b2a-a080-ad4be0b3b38a","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"a0e1ddbc-876e-4365-9394-2ed8831593ba","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"bb1088e1-668e-4295-aef7-9850fee44678","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"e07ee00e-ac6c-45f8-a5ff-5cded2909178","date":"2026-06-21","images":[]},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"9c13f2dd-5f66-44fc-b0d5-cd29b9afa319","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"513c17b4-cd2e-4800-bc69-e4c1708099c8","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"73f702ef-8afd-4a76-9ebb-e8b9e687e9a9","date":"2026-05-30","images":[]},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"edf644db-f033-4f2d-b225-7752eada43d4","date":"2026-05-19","images":[]},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"d2c1408e-acf2-47f6-91f7-5fcc6f18974a","date":"2026-05-14","images":[]},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"f1a4a4e6-d1e1-4cdd-911e-bf7e127c189b","date":"2025-09-28","images":[]},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"ab3097f7-d1ce-4b79